[{"title":"新秋晚眺","author":"德隐","text":"山中多晚凉，清风厉秋节。\n遥瞻四五峰，壁立皆奇绝。\n修竹傍林开，乔松倚岩列。\n黄菊散芳丛，清泉凝白雪。\n对此怀素心，千里共明月。\n愿保幽贞姿，岁寒双皎洁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29537,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"种竹歌","author":"德隐","text":"南山南，北山北，其中有竹人不识。\n托根数茎临严霜，虚心愿并幽溪柏。\n秋深草木零落尽，此竹亭亭终不易。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29538,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日泣怀先慈","author":"德隐","text":"兰闺仪范廿年馀，德耀神葩玉不如。\n坐帐每教吟五字，遗奁亲自绘双鱼。\n最怜辛苦怀兰佩，犹忆提携载鹿车。\n风木有情肠欲断，梦中空自学牵裾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29539,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"当湖文园闻已填茂草慰外君","author":"德隐","text":"遥望残阳落故墟，更传烽火遍州闾。\n绿沈渭亩临溪竹，香散文园满架书。\n钓艇苍茫浮少伯，琴台寂寞忆相如。\n多君腹笥依然在，词赋翩翩好似初。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29540,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祀寒山先墓","author":"德隐","text":"一天风雨倍伤离，回首寒泉曲涧西。\n伯道祠边猿独唳，中郎墓上鸟空啼。\n尘飞台阁书还在，雪压松筠鹤自栖。\n从此素丝凭世染，漫怜志与白云齐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29541,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"皆令黄夫人过寓山闺即事","author":"德隐","text":"吟得新诗子夜残，银釭点点照花栏。\n须臾小婢来相报，深竹乌啼月满滩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29542,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"美人","author":"德隐","text":"眉锁春山鬓点鸦，莫将桃李斗芳华。\n无心去逐风流队，閒向雕阑数落花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29543,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题莲花","author":"维极","text":"幻出是毫间，休作《爱莲说》。\n花叶不沾尘，从今莫饶舌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29544,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆维极师","author":"超越","text":"冰雪家风古，萧然丈室中。\n当年亲教诲，数语发愚蒙。\n生死恩难报，箕裘愧未工。\n妙峰还掬土，道范邈何穷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29545,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"明萱","text":"忽见梧桐染淡黄，更闻鶗鴂叫秋霜。\n不因白发催明镜，且抱红心寄上方。\n就竹开窗通海月，当庭种桂散天香。\n閒来拥衲凭高坐，静听疏钟万虑忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29546,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落叶 其一","author":"明萱","text":"消瘦寒林意自凄，可怜零落任东西。\n妒风何苦相凌逼，眷恋枝头不忍离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29547,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落叶 其二","author":"明萱","text":"霜染千秋色不同，纵然娇艳也成空。\n凭风分付东流去，耐等寒枝春不穷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29548,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题英石","author":"明萱","text":"寂寞东山草更萋，孤峰独立绝恒蹊。\n年来不与人相见，风雨萧萧鸟自啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29549,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书斋偶咏","author":"元端","text":"榻寄閒窗下，相携话昔游。\n烹茶成雅集，开卷足清修。\n宿雨花生润，微风鸟自讴。\n留将残照影，静拂素丝幽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29550,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"燕","author":"石岩","text":"满院晴光好，穿帘小燕纷。\n数声惊午梦，双剪碎春云。\n戏水香泥湿，冲烟夕照曛。\n参差频上下，红嘴掠青芹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29551,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春夜与阆音师咏月","author":"石岩","text":"皓月轻飞处，经堂寂不哗。\n碎光穿竹罅，圆影架枝叉。\n露湿巢喧雀，风梳草乱蛙。\n与师清课后，相对理袈裟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29552,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓起遣兴","author":"石岩","text":"风扫云残霁色开，松根驯鹤舞苍苔。\n蚁拖榆荚缘墙去，蜂抱花须扑槛来。\n一雨绿盈分竹院，四山青压鼓琴台。\n悠然独立斜阳下，结阵乌鸢噪古槐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29553,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆梦","author":"石岩","text":"蕉团稳坐好安禅，炯炯金镫法座燃。\n慧鸟鸣来深树里，乱山飞入小窗前。\n云镕碧海摩晴日，露洗空天散晓烟。\n记得梦中参我佛，色空空色悟真诠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29554,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答蕊仙六姊","author":"石岩","text":"巫峡行云梦已遥，不须禅棒与诗瓢。\n白云深处青山里，一个蒲团万虑消。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29555,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题达摩像","author":"石岩","text":"折苇江流疾似帆，九年枯坐向寒岩。\n静中悟得言诠妄，笑把如来《大藏》缄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29556,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"般若招提晓坐","author":"妙惠","text":"夜雨洗山岩，朝来翠独湿。\n趺坐学观空，清风满香积。\n正因字本无，而我好翰墨。\n心即等死灰，未了人间孽。\n窗竹皆虚心，庭松多劲节。\n体此长青树，原不在虚实。\n何况钟鱼间，梵理更无得。\n坐久闻妙香，慈航如可接。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29557,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书怀柬紫蘩女史","author":"寂居","text":"花钿翠袖久蠲除，经案绳床意自如。\n性懒已忘憍慢习，家贫犹惜旧藏书。\n谈空有弟穷禅理，适兴从亲学蠹鱼。\n更喜萧疏尘虑少，草衣木食足安居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29558,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"幽居静坐","author":"静诺","text":"幽居惟自适，一编聊自遣。\n白昼一何长，安不自黾勉。\n古人虽往矣，微旨亦须阐。\n空檐滴长漏，炉香生宝篆。\n每当兴会嘉，双手不释卷。\n嗟哉世俗子，不解亲坟典。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29559,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮作","author":"静诺","text":"时序自推迁，忽然惊岁暮。\n举目见寒鸦，悲鸣如欲诉。\n太阳惨不舒，同云四野布。\n朔风时北来，哀号满庭户。\n翘首望阳春，阳春不我顾。\n居诸如隙驹，剥啄有定数。\n况我世外人，浮云已如故。\n园有数株梅，结伴尽堪度。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29560,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古梅歌","author":"静诺","text":"阆苑琼姿不记年，屈曲古干如龙盘。\n大庾万枝只如此，回旋曲折空山里。\n吐萼枝枝色正妍，移来小艇泊流泉。\n斜枝倒侵冰魂化，狂呼游客添杯斝。\n我欲携筇过隔溪，竹林主人远相迓。\n莫谓韶光还久留，人生适意多偷暇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29561,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过永庆寺逢牡丹作","author":"静诺","text":"东风习习春将夏，宝马香车如放假。\n夹道松杉满径阴，黄鹂坐语春风下。\n偏反绰约逞娇颜，徘徊终日不知还。\n花王似殿东王令，好鸟枝头笳鼓竞。\n莫言花落不如人，人老能如花更春。\n惟有青山常对峙，年年花落路傍尘。\n小鸟欲答忽飞去，宛转如歌昔时句。\n但使衰年无病侵，岁岁花前常小憩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29562,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日晚晴","author":"静诺","text":"窗白雨将去，犹存一帐寒。\n神清无俗梦，心定不生澜。\n红湿知莲苦，声迟识漏残。\n画梁新燕小，窥栋语般般。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29563,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟泊姑苏","author":"静诺","text":"扁舟今夜泊，遥对阖闾城。\n霞落浦云晚，鸦眠山月明。\n片帆归路远，千里客心惊。\n鼓枻不成寐，萧萧何处声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29564,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河渚初睡","author":"静诺","text":"石枕藤床万虑忘，跏趺不逐世间忙。\n风生蒲扇人情冷，竹映纱窗月影凉。\n随地可消清夜永，无心尝戴野荷香。\n门迎流水尘声远，槛外松涛入耳长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29565,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠杨夫人","author":"静诺","text":"一种高风迥绝尘，何缘邂逅觉生春。\n青莲堪证无生法，紫诰仍辉现在身。\n性洁自甘泉石操，谈玄喜与法王亲。\n金陵风物称殊绝，道左流连话转深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29566,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春宵即事","author":"静诺","text":"野藤花气暗随风，狼藉春光一半空。\n斜倚石栏频望处，满庭明月有无中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29567,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阅楞严经","author":"静诺","text":"青莲自是出淤泥，在处明心更不迷。\n寄语学人须著意，本来无染即菩提。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29568,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏秋兰","author":"静诺","text":"长林众草入秋荒，独有幽姿逗晚香。\n每向风前堪寄傲，几因霜后欲留芳。\n名流赏鉴还堪佩，空谷知音品自扬。\n一种孤怀千古在，湘江词赋奏清商。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29569,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋海棠","author":"僧鉴","text":"红甲垂垂白露姿，薜萝墙下最堪宜。\n不教鹦鹉呼肥婢，肯与莲花作侍儿。\n几处闭门秋雨后，何人立月晚香时。\n愁肠欲断非关汝，续命无烦叶底丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29570,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏","author":"僧鉴","text":"落尽红芳入夏初，槐阴绕屋竹扶疏。\n清风一室閒钟磬，疏雨幽窗自看书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29571,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋宵对月","author":"静维","text":"夜静天地凉，凭楼独凝眺。\n烟树色离离，云山望中杳。\n万籁寂无声，数萤流木杪。\n青镫照罗幕，残叶铺池沼。\n悲哉今古情，乾坤徒浩渺。\n忧怀自苍茫，至意漠难晓。\n姮娥知我愁，流影来相照。\n当持金石心，千秋同皎皎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29572,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题春草堂 其一","author":"静维","text":"谢公游眺地，春草已无根。\n夕巷牛羊下，空檐鸟雀喧。\n可怜盱盼尽，徒有简编存。\n泪洒西州路，何人酹一樽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29573,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题春草堂 其二","author":"静维","text":"十载重游地，孤城带落晖。\n西园迷旧迹，北渚长新矶。\n玉树人俱尽，金庭事已非。\n何须闻短笛，独立自沾衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29574,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠圣幢师","author":"静维","text":"自是闺中秀，超然远物华。\n心能同水月，骨自带烟霞。\n翠长真如竹，黄开般若花。\n寄言刘铁磨，应识赵州茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29575,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"静维","text":"残镫照帘幕，楼阁有馀情。\n落叶堆蛩砌，凉风吹雁声。\n暮蝉愁里听，河汉望中横。\n独坐悲秋夜，疏棂淡月莹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29576,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居杂感","author":"静维","text":"春山斜远郭，渌水满晴川。\n白鸟孤云外，青林返照边。\n风波何处少，耕凿此中偏。\n莫作途穷叹，聊同鹿豕全。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29577,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"碧海","author":"静维","text":"碧海风涛静不飞，凌霄高阁敞云扉。\n拥书千卷无人到，剪烛三更有鹤归。\n汉殿香消青鸟去，缑山秋冷玉笙微。\n劫灰辨得馀悲怆，独向人间寄衲衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29578,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辞世偈","author":"传正","text":"五十馀年似梦中，今朝四大各西东。\n了明性海无生法，更有何言说苦空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29579,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祖母命题菊花","author":"智生","text":"帘暮暗生香，奇葩胜艳妆。\n不随秋草萎，独立傲繁霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29580,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日风雨","author":"智生","text":"何事催春去，残红逐雨飞。\n飘风无处所，来岁可能归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29581,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"智生","text":"长信宫中侍宴来，玉颜偏映夜光杯。\n银筝弹罢《霓裳曲》，又报西宫侍女催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29582,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏词","author":"智生","text":"炎威天气日偏长，汗湿轻罗倚画窗。\n蜂蝶不知春已去，又衔花瓣到兰房。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29583,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏雪","author":"智生","text":"霏霏玉屑点窗纱，碎碎琼珂响翠华。\n乍可庭前吟柳絮，不知何处认梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29584,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏新柳","author":"德日","text":"嫩软新枝不受肥，小蛮醉舞比腰围。\n欲舒青眼情难寄，但说蛾眉事总非。\n纤巧莺梭轻拂缕，翩翻燕剪欲裁衣。\n随风婀娜春无限，销尽吟魂好句稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29585,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮春苦雨即事","author":"德日","text":"年来惟有感伤多，九十春光总浪过。\n镜里容颜空自老，梦中诗句为谁哦。\n飞花满院销银蜡，细雨空帘锁黛蛾。\n可惜繁华零落尽，香残酒冷奈愁何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29586,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中新柳","author":"德日","text":"深黄浅绿雨中新，才倚雕栏更损神。\n翠色最宜侵少妇，柔条未可赠离人。\n衣沾清泪时时湿，眉染浓烟故故颦。\n无力舞风飞更歇，由来腰细不胜春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29587,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦醒闻雁却忆女弟","author":"德日","text":"依稀莲步梦中来，忽听孤鸿意自哀。\n尔来失群予忆妹，烦君寄泪到妆台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29588,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新燕","author":"德日","text":"穿径衔泥漾好春，翩翩斗舞羽毛新。\n暖风吹入昭阳殿，妒煞轻盈赵美人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29589,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨窗有感","author":"德日","text":"梨花零落事堪悲，诉与孤窗夜雨知。\n静坐几回怜命薄，颦蛾正是断肠时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29590,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"茉莉","author":"德日","text":"一笑风前尽吐香，摘来几朵倍芬芳。\n琼姿馥馥羞珠翠，留与婵娟助晚妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29591,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月下梅影","author":"德日","text":"轻笼淡月异浓妆，欲赋惭无白雪香。\n却到夜深人静后，一枝移向碧纱窗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29592,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻邻女哭声","author":"德日","text":"閒看征雁立花阴，处处西风落叶惊。\n我为相思肠欲断，不堪又听断肠声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29593,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初秋 其一","author":"德日","text":"萧然一叶下梧桐，初觉凉生小阁风。\n暑气潜消人意爽，卧看新月到帘栊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29594,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初秋 其二","author":"德日","text":"凉夜西风枕簟清，钟声送月傍柴荆。\n寒蛩也识秋光到，砌下窗前处处鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29595,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初秋 其三","author":"德日","text":"轻烟冷露染衣寒，无数流萤绕画栏。\n睡起悄然时怅望，秋声一片在林端。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29596,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨夜梦与冰心女兄话旧醒来拈韵","author":"德月","text":"孤窗閒卧不胜愁，梦逐娇痴旧地游。\n绣阁牵衣欣聚首，妆台倚膝倩梳头。\n惊魂夜半萧疏雨，分袂更残寂寞楼。\n枕上伤心无数泪，晚来宁忍一舒眸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29597,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送花女兄","author":"德月","text":"遥想娉婷态，晓妆梳裹鲜。\n玉英三四朵，送缀绿云边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29598,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜闻蛩","author":"德月","text":"蛩音唧唧最关情，无限秋光映画屏。\n银烛高烧更漏永，不堪听处总成吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29599,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其一","author":"德月","text":"无聊月下独焚香，暑气微消渐觉凉。\n徙倚花前频怅望，何时重见玉人妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29600,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其二","author":"德月","text":"小院凉生落叶风，天街玉露湿花浓。\n怀君泪笔难题句，瘦减腰围总病中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29601,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其三","author":"德月","text":"小阁閒凭远绪生，香茶独啜不胜清。\n遥思月下吹箫态，料对乘龙跨凤人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29602,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其四","author":"德月","text":"梦里相逢泪似波，云烟共涤对君多。\n秋声惊起愁人恨，怅望遥天横玉河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29603,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其五","author":"德月","text":"携愁带病强吟哦，自恨红颜薄命多。\n一夜诗成无数泪，从今休想对君歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29604,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其六","author":"德月","text":"多病伤神力不支，一弯新月照愁思。\n昨宵魂梦牵衫袖，拈韵依稀赋别诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29605,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其七","author":"德月","text":"贪看新月不成眠，仿佛清宵对玉娟。\n诗思君家推绝调，吟成白雪却非盐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29606,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其八","author":"德月","text":"新诗赋就更添妆，散步回廊转画堂。\n多病慈亲欣执手，愁中对月且流觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29607,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香奁和姊氏韵 其九","author":"德月","text":"凋零门户不成家，骨肉相看空自嗟。\n愁到夜深浑欲寐，杜鹃啼破绿窗纱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29608,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]